## [Development version]
### Added
- PDM_mesh_intersection: Add unit tests for surface-surface intersection
### Changed
- PDM_part_mesh_nodal :
  - Internal structure organized into arrays indexed by dimension to facilitate better factorization in the future
- PDM_rotation :
  - improve precision of quaternions and add unit tests
- PDM_timer :
  - Add tree timer
  - Json export
  - Inclusive/Exclusive time and basic information for timer (min/max)
  - Synchronize timer on option
  - Pretty print in stdout / log / string
### Fixed
- PDM_part_octree :
  - Fix wrong heap allocation avoiding heap is full crash
### Deprecated
### Removed
- Remove fake brace for emacs editor & clean all licensing (outdated)
### Fixed
- PDM_mesh_intersection: Fix numerical issues in surface-surface intersection
- PDM_domain_interface_translate_face2vtx: prevent crash caused by ``n_face_this_edge == 2`` assertion
## [2.8.0] - 2026-05-21
### Added
- PDM_isosurface:
  - Add accessors
  - Expand Python API
  - Test more configurations in CI
- PDM_laplacian_smoothing: New service for Laplacian smoothing
- PDM_mpi: Add unit tests
- PDM_multipart: Automatically register a PDM_part_comm_graph to output PDM_part_mesh_nodal structures
- PDM_part_comm_graph:
  - Add documentation
  - Add accessors
  - Add services for splitting, concatenation and filtering
  - Add Python and Fortran APIs
- PDM_part_geom: Add function to compute vertex normals
- PDM_part_graph_dual: Add a function to assemble a generic dual graph from a partitioned graph
- PDM_part_mesh_nodal:
  - Add functions to convert groups to element tags, and vice versa
  - Add accessors
  - Expand Python API
- PDM_writer: Add accessors
- PDM_array: Add more array utilities
- PDM_exchange_helper: New low-level service to factorize utilities for high-level protocol exchanges
- PDM_mesh_repart (**ParaDiGMA**): Enable implicit ``part_id_idx``
- PDM_part_migrate (**ParaDiGMA**):
  - Add accessors
  - Add function to translate PDM_part_comm_graph
  - Add unit tests
### Changed
- Refactoring CMake files
- PDM_mpi: Refactoring to streamline the MPI wrapper
- PDM_part_mesh_nodal: Dissociate *vertices* and *corners* for embedded PDM_part_comm_graph
- PDM_reader_gamma: Comply with the standard for 2D meshes and solutions
- Cython: Replace capsules by constructors from raw C pointers
### Deprecated
- PDM_iso_surface (**ParaDiGMA**): Prototype replaced by the improved PDM_isosurface service
### Removed
- PDM_isosurface: Remove the PDM_isosurface_distribution_get function (was buggy)
- Remove deprecated / unused prototypes:
  - **ParaDiGM**: PDM_edge_intersect, PDM_graph_bound, PDM_mesh_adapt, PDM_overlay, PDM_part_bound, PDM_poly_clipp
  - **ParaDiGMA**: PDM_delaunay, PDM_cavity_operator, PDM_mesh_adaptation, PDM_mesh_generation
### Fixed
- Fix compilation warnings
- Fix memory leaks
- Prevent divisions by zero (PDM_dcube_nodal_gen, PDM_hilbert)
- PDM_box_tree: fix vectorization issue with icx (backported from version 2.7.1)
- PDM_global_mean: Fix case with n_part = 0
- PDM_isosurface:
  - Fix cases with no surface groups
  - Return ``iso_edge_vtx_idx`` as ``None`` in Python interface
  - Fix ellipse equation
  - Remove degenerate iso-edges
- PDM_dist_cloud_surf: Fix case with empty mesh
- PDM_mesh_intersection: Fix uninitialized ``tetraisation_pt_type`` parameter
- PDM_multipart: Fix output PDM_part_mesh_nodal memory ownership
- PDM_part_mesh_nodal:
  - Fix construction of topological ridges
  - Improve error messages
  - Orientation consistency for 2D nodal meshes reconstructed from face->edge connectivity (backported from version 2.7.1)
- PDM_part_to_part: Fix errors in Python interface (use after free, wrong size for stride arrays)
- PDM_reader_gamma: Fix orientation of quads in 2D
- Renumbering (**ParaDiGMA**): Various fixes
## [2.7.0] - 2025-09-27
### Added
- PDM_convex: New file for convex geometry computations (eg. point-in-convex-hull query)
- PDM_extract_part: Add support for volume groups
- PDM_isosurface: Add Fortran API
- PDM_multipart: Enable use of user-defined target partitions
- PDM_part_comm_graph: Add "with nuplet" mode
- PDM_part_mesh: Embedded PDM_part_comm_graph
- PDM_part_mesh_nodal:
  - Compute dual volumes
  - Find topological ridges and corners
  - Embedded PDM_part_comm_graph
- PDM_part_to_part: Add Python interface for creation from triplets
- PDM_rotation: New file for handling rigid-body rotations
- Unit tests:
  - algorithm: PDM_binary_search, PDM_hash_tab, PDM_quick_sort, PDM_sort
  - exchange_protocol: PDM_part_to_part
  - geometry: PDM_ho_basis, PDM_part_mesh_nodal, PDM_polygon, PDM_predicate
  - gnum_utils: PDM_gnum_location
  - mesh: PDM_closest_points, PDM_mesh_location
  - mesh_struct: PDM_part_domain_interface, PDM_part_mesh
  - mesh_topology: PDM_cellface_orient
  - meshgen: PDM_box_gen, PDM_point_cloud_gen, PDM_sphere_surf_gen, PDM_sphere_vol_gen
  - ppart: PDM_multipart, PDM_partitioning_algorithm
  - struct: PDM_linear_programming
- Documentation:
  - More documented features with some examples of use
  - Add release notes
### Changed
- Cleaner organization of source files
- Documentation:
  - New theme
  - Rearrange families of features
  - Improve description of features
- PDM_dist_cloud_surf: Remove 'partial' argument in free
- PDM_extract_part: Add ownership in accessors
- PDM_mpi: Replace Issend by Isend
- PDM_part_comm_graph: Add ownership
- PDM_part_mesh_nodal:
  - Split setter for vertices into 2 functions: coordinates and global IDs
  - Add ownership arguments
- PDM_point_location, PDM_mean_values: Improve interpolation weights for points located outside polyhedral cells (used in PDM_mesh_location )
### Deprecated
### Removed
- Obsolete and unfinished source files and tests
### Fixed
- Porting to gcc14, gcc15 and Cython 3 (tested in GitLab CI)
- PDM_gnum :
  - Fix Python API for "from parent" mode with nuplet
  - Fix Fortran interface
- Removed memory leaks
